 "In this cozy and heart-warming visual novel, you will join Julia while she helps those who come into the agency. How is that so? This lovely witch can summon spirits!\n\nAfter years of training, studying and perfectioning her skills and crafts, Julia has finally opened her own magic shop following her mum\u2019s steps. She will help anyone in need, acting as a bridge between spirits and their loved ones, so they can deal with their pending matters and, in the end, rest in peace.", "summary": "Cozy visual novel about a lovely witch who\u2019s able to talk to spirits in a fantasy setting. Using her powers, Julia helps her neighbors in their daily whereabouts. Craft potions, find the right time to use them and get to know both spirits and clients to find their peace.", "themes": [{"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/spirit-talk", "videos": [{"id": 174365, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Kq1bVFs0aMw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kq1bVFs0aMw", "title": "TRAILER Spirit Talk - Cozy Visual Novel - STEAM GAME", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Kq1bVFs0aMw/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185936, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "k1bxr0gC144", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k1bxr0gC144", "title": "Spirit Talk - Launch TRAILER  - Cozy Visual Novel", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k1bxr0gC144/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 194657, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "kmH_hGW2AoI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kmH_hGW2AoI", "title": "SPIRIT TALK | Mundo Gamer Showcase 2026.2 (June)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kmH_hGW2AoI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}